  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles: Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil for the noodles. Cook the noodles in the pan of boiling water for 7 mins or until tender (see Kitchen 101). Drain, then rinse under hot water to prevent the noodles from sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218940/photos/large/339537_1-8158fcf9a89688f5d7cbbb3a5f56de86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Meanwhile, shred the zucchini and carrot using a julienne peeler or coarsely grate with a box grater.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218945/photos/large/339537_2-850f5fbc8cd6dd7c50e02cbe4a9f9753.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep tofu: Cut the tofu into 2cm cubes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218950/photos/large/339537_3-2c58eb29d3998115e8ac9b804a063ea5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make stock: Put the stock powder and 1 tsp sugar in a heatproof jug, add 750ml (3 cups) boiling water and stir to dissolve. Stir in 2 tsp soy sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218954/photos/large/339537_4-67748553711fa9d215a8955141720ff9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the noodles, vegetables and tofu among bowls, then pour over the stock mixture. Scatter with a small pinch of chilli flakes, if using, and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218959/photos/large/339537_5-5ee6b0c70f3ef80250ea13bfc891742f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Stir the noodles every now and then while they are boiling to prevent them sticking together.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218962/photos/large/339537_6-6008943387a372362a097cc2b5e7fe2e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
